# Requester — `[Claims]` (under 7 - Expenses)

### [Claims] As a user I can browse claim lists (Draft/Rejected/Pending/Approved) and open a claim's details [eBloxHR,HRSS]
**Priority:** P1
> All four status lists reuse the **same screen/card template**, so they are grouped here. Each list
> shows claim cards, and tapping a card navigates to that claim's **detail** — detail verification per
> state is therefore covered as part of this case.

| # | Action | Expected |
|--|--|--|
| 1 | User opens the **Claims** tile on the home screen. *Make sure to test for both HRSS & eBloxHR* | - Claims overview opens<br>- two tabs: **Open** and **Sent**<br>- last-selected tab is persisted between visits |
| 2 | User views the **Open** tab | - shows **Rejected** claims (only when `rejectedClaimsCount > 0`), **Draft** claims, and **Unassigned expenses**<br>- correct empty state (full or per-section) when a section is empty |
| 3 | User views the **Sent** tab | - shows **Pending** and **Approved** claims |
| 4 | User inspects a claim **card** (any status — same template) | - card shows title/employee name, total(s) and date<br>- **[MOCK]** multi-currency: totals from `totalAmounts` render; when >2 currencies only the **top two** are shown, formatted `0.000,00 EUR` |
| 5 | From the **Draft** claims list, user taps a card | - navigates to the **Draft claim detail**<br>- **Draft** state label; **Submit for approval** present (Draft/Rejected only) |
| 6 | From the **Rejected** list (red banner), user taps a card | - navigates to the **Rejected claim detail**<br>- **Rejected** label + general rejection message; rejected-expenses list shows each expense's **`approverComment`**; **Submit for approval** present |
| 7 | From the **Pending** list (Sent tab), user taps a card | - navigates to the **Pending claim detail**<br>- **Pending** label; **no Submit** action (terminal for requester until approver acts) |
| 8 | From the **Approved** list (Sent tab), user taps a card | - navigates to the **Approved claim detail**<br>- **Approved** label; not editable, not eligible for linking |
| 9 | User reviews common detail elements across states | - correct **state label**; total(s) and claim date shown; **description hidden when empty/null**; **details link hidden when `canViewDetails=false`**; expense items listed |

### [Claims] As a user I can create a new expense claim (Draft) [eBloxHR,HRSS]
**Priority:** P1
| # | Action | Expected |
|--|--|--|
| 1 | User taps the **FAB / Quick Action → "Create a new claim"** on Claims overview | - provider **Form** opens full-screen<br>- (availability) action shown only when a valid `endpointUri` is returned |
| 2 | User fills the required Form fields | - inline provider validation applies<br>- **Save** button appears **only after a change** is recognised |
| 3 | User taps **Save** | - claim created in **Draft**<br>- user redirected to the **Draft claim detail**<br>- new claim appears in the Draft list under **Open** |
| 4 | User repeats but taps **Back/Cancel** before Save | - nothing is persisted; no claim created |
| 5 | Invalid `endpointUri` / Form fails to load **[MOCK]** | - "action unavailable" / "cannot be displayed" message; on submit error the user stays on the Form and can retry |

### [Claims] As a user I can add an expense and link it to a claim [eBloxHR,HRSS]
**Priority:** P1
| # | Action | Expected |
|--|--|--|
| 1 | From **Claims context**, user starts **Add expense** and fills the expense | - standard expense creation screen; when opened from Claims, extra bottom actions appear: **Add to claim** (primary) and **Save** (secondary) |
| 2 | User taps **Save** (secondary) | - expense created as **unassigned** (no link); appears in the Unassigned expenses list |
| 3 | User taps **Add to claim** (primary) | - **Select claim** screen opens (radio, single-select) |
| 4 | User selects a claim and confirms (**Add to this claim**) | - expense **linked**; removed from Unassigned; user lands on the **claim detail** showing the expense; claim total updates |

### [Claims] As a user I can link an unassigned expense from all entry points [eBloxHR,HRSS]
**Priority:** P1
| # | Action | Expected |
|--|--|--|
| 1 | Link from **unassigned expense detail → "Add to claim"** | - Select-claim screen opens; on confirm the expense links and is removed from Unassigned |
| 2 | Link from **Unassigned list** multi-select → bottom sheet **"Add to claim"** | - bottom-sheet action enabled only when **≥1** selected (greyed at 0); on confirm all selected expenses link |
| 3 | Link from **claim detail → "Add unassigned expenses"** (`canLinkExpenses=true`) | - selection screen shows linkable expenses; on confirm they attach to that claim |
| 4 | Link from the **expense creation** flow → "Add to claim" | - behaves as the create+link path; expense ends linked |
| 5 | Backend / network error during link **[MOCK]** | - expense **remains unassigned**; retry available on network/timeout |

